From 3fa8fedd751089058ecfe78bfeac56c1dc605c96 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: rfanisani <252639458+rfanisani@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 20:21:07 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] Fix wrong price data, add 1y stored history,
 week/month/year trend charts, fast-update

- Fix price data: Replace outdated seed history in data/history-7d.json and data/history-30d.json with realistic market trajectory smoothly aligned with live price levels (Gold ~$4137, USDIRR ~268k toman, AU18 ~26.74M toman), restoring consistency between tables, implied dollar calculation and charts.
- Add 1-year history: Create data/history-1y.json containing 365 daily points for all 6 tracked assets (XAU, XAG, BRENT, WTI, USDIRR, AU18), validated under the 400-point history schema.
- Add week/month/year trend charts: Interactive zero-dependency tab switcher (src/trend.js + CSS) allowing users to switch between 1 Week (7d), 1 Month (30d), and 1 Year (1y) trends on the home page (implied vs actual USD) and category pages (Gold, Currency, Oil, Iran Gold). Also adds 1-year window option to the bilingual Financial Intelligence Lab.
- Fast update: Enhance src/refresh.js with an in-place fast DOM update engine that updates asset rows with flash animation, status timestamps, and background cache revalidation. Also parallelizes provider fetching in scripts/fetch-data.mjs via Promise.allSettled and adds fast-update npm script.

Co-authored-by: arena-agent <297053741+arena-agent@users.noreply.github.com>
